<title>BELGIUM: EU farm committee agrees forestry proposals.</title>
<headline>EU farm committee agrees forestry proposals.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's special committee on agriculture agreed to two Commission proposals to protect forests against air pollution and fires, an EU official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The committee agreed this week but the vote was postponed until Monday in order to have the proposal in all the official languages&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The proposals will be formally adopted without discussion as an &quot;A&quot; point at a forthcoming EU Council.</p>
</text>
